OL,3,AMechanic who falsified MOT before fatal
OL,4,Acrash handed community order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mechanic who gave a car a fraudulent
OL,7,FMOT just weeks before it was involved
OL,8,Fin a fatal crash that killed three
OL,9,Fpeople has been given a 12-month
OL,10,Fcommunity order.
OL,12,FNeil John Lewis, 47, from Cardiff, had
OL,13,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to fraud by
OL,14,Ffalse representation.
OL,16,FEve Smith, 21, Darcy Ross, 21, and
OL,17,FRafel Jeanne, 24, died when the car
OL,18,Fcrashed into woodland in in St Mellons,
OL,19,FCardiff, in March 2023. They lay
OL,20,Fundiscovered for two days. Two other
OL,21,Fpeople survived.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
