OL,3,AMechanic who falsified MOT before fatal
OL,4,Acrash handed community order
OL,5,
OL,6,FCardiff Magistrates' Court heard Lewis
OL,7,Fhad owned G and J Motors for 21 years
OL,8,Fand had voluntarily surrendered his
OL,9,Ftesting certificate following the
OL,10,Fincident.
